{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794533956429,"sessionID":"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9","part":{"partID":"prt_1d28f1a41002qOG832Pfhbw973","sessionID":"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9","messageID":"msg_1d28f0c3c001BOybPF9futGOpl","type":"tool","id":"call_b4807112c5404630b4ab625f","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"presentation\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/*.yaml | head -40"},"output":".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-scaffold.yaml:89:      - \"Render the presentation contract's scaffold plan: the target path, the templates, the switch group, the timeout, the README rows and the whole proposed file.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-scaffold.yaml:103:      - \"When the file was created and read back, render the presentation contract's mutating result with the path, the first line, the report row and the undo step (STATUS=OK).\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-scaffold.yaml:112:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-report.yaml:6:action: Run .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/ci-report.cjs once -> render its table and status line through the presentation contract\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-restore.yaml:43:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-restore.yaml:64:      - \"Read .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt for the plan, question and result wording. Every visible line comes from there.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-restore.yaml:73:      - \"Exit 0 with a plan is the case this route asks about. Exit 0 with --dry-run never asks anything, so a dry run renders the presentation contract's dry-run result and goes to phase 6 with STATUS=OK.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-restore.yaml:79:      - \"Ask the restore question once, in the presentation contract's wording, naming the run directory, each path that will be put back and each path that will be removed because the recorded run created it.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-restore.yaml:102:      - \"Render the presentation contract's restored result with the run directory, each path put back, each path removed, the re-read verdict and STATUS=OK.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-restore.yaml:112:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-toggle.yaml:72:      - \"When the plan status is NO_CHANGE, the variable already has the requested state: render the presentation contract's no-change result and stop with STATUS=OK and no change. Never run a command that changes nothing.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-toggle.yaml:77:      - \"Render the presentation contract's change plan from the planner's output: the variable, its current state, the requested state, the workflows it covers and the exact command. For state off the command is gh variable set <name> --body off. For state on the command is gh variable delete <name>.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-toggle.yaml:93:      - \"When the change was approved and read back, render the presentation contract's mutating result with the command, the verification and the undo command (STATUS=OK).\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-toggle.yaml:101:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-check.yaml:6:action: Run .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs once -> render its row table through the presentation contract\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-check.yaml:59:    - \"Render the engine's output through .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt: the row table as printed, the DOCTOR DIAGNOSTIC RESULT summary and the repair for each finding.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-setup.yaml:6:action: Run .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/git-setup-check.cjs once -> render its per-check PASS/FAIL/SKIP/UNKNOWN/DEGRADED verdict and repair lines through the presentation contract\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-setup.yaml:51:    - \"Render the battery's verdict through .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-presentation.txt: the per-check table and the DOCTOR DIAGNOSTIC RESULT summary, with the repair command under each failure.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:85:      - \"Render the presentation contract's standards status and source list\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:93:      - \"Ask the presentation's init prompt; on approve run node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/git-standards.cjs init --apply --json, on anything else render the presentation contract's cancelled result (STATUS=CANCELLED ACTION=cancelled) and stop\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:99:      - \"Ask the presentation's change menu; on done, go to phase_7_report\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:105:      - \"For a setting: run node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/git-standards.cjs set <kind> <dotted.path> <json-value> --json; a removal passes null. Render the presentation's rule change plan with the rules switched on and off and the prose drift\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:106:      - \"For a kind: run node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/git-standards.cjs disable <kind> --json and render the presentation's stop-enforcing plan\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:120:      - \"When the plan listed prose to update, ask the presentation's prose prompt. On approve, edit only the prose lines in the .sk-git/ template that the drift findings name, so they state the new rule; never touch the rules block by hand\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:127:      - \"Render the presentation contract's result: success with each applied change, the files written, the last check result and the undo for each\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:135:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:53:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:76:      - \"Read .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt for the plan, question, refusal and result wording. Every visible line comes from there.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:84:      - \"Exit 0 with NOTHING TO DO means the repository is already in its target state, which the engine prints without a plan. Render the presentation contract's unchanged result with the engine's own notes, ask nothing, write nothing and go to phase 6 with STATUS=OK.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:86:      - \"If dry_run is true, render the presentation contract's dry-run result from the plan's own lines, print the dry-run line and go to phase 6 with STATUS=OK. A dry run asks nothing and writes nothing, so it runs no question and no apply.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:92:      - \"Ask the embed question once, in the presentation contract's wording, naming the files the plan will create, replace or remove, the backup folder, the router rows the plan would add and the plan digest. The operator answers about the plan the operator has just read, which is this run's plan.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:102:      - \"A nonzero pointer-sync line is the one verdict the run leaves unresolved: the generator rewrites an existing .cursor/rules/skill-routing.md and never creates a missing one, so a repository without that file ends with exit 1 and the mirror still missing. Keep the line as printed, render it in the result's Pointer sync: field, never list .cursor/rules/skill-routing.md in Files changed on the strength of the allowlist that names it, and render a Next: line naming /doctor:runtime-mirrors, whose rows list each generated mirror that drifts with the write form of its checker. The repair chain for the pointer file itself is the presentation's troubleshooting row for A10, because that route does not check it. A repo-rules line that reports an error belongs in Router: the same way.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:117:      - \"When the write ran and read back, render the presentation contract's embedded result with the paths the engine wrote or removed, the pointer-sync and repo-rules lines as they printed, the backup folder, the re-read verdict, the undo block the engine printed and the next line those lines name.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:129:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-hooks.yaml:87:      - \"Render the presentation contract's gate table and hand-off block, naming /doctor:env for the whole-hook kill switches\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-hooks.yaml:88:      - \"Ask the presentation contract's change prompt; on done, go to phase_5_report\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-hooks.yaml:93:      - \"Run node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/git-hook-gates.cjs set <key> on|off --scope local|global --json, which writes nothing, and render its plan with the presentation contract's change plan\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-hooks.yaml:94:      - \"If the script refuses the key (exit 2), render its reason, add the presentation's pointer for that switch, and return to phase_2_present\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-hooks.yaml:109:      - \"When every approved change verified, render the presentation contract's success result with each change, its scope, the verification and its undo command (STATUS=OK)\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-hooks.yaml:117:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-presentation.txt\"\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-scaffold.yaml:89:      - \"Render the presentation contract's scaffold plan: the target path, the templates, the switch group, the timeout, the README rows and the whole proposed file.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-scaffold.yaml:103:      - \"When the file was created and read back, render the presentation contract's mutating result with the path, the first line, the report row and the undo step (STATUS=OK).\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-scaffold.yaml:112:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-report.yaml:6:action: Run .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/ci-report.cjs once -> render its table and status line through the presentation contract\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-restore.yaml:43:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-restore.yaml:64:      - \"Read .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt for the plan, question and result wording. Every visible line comes from there.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-restore.yaml:73:      - \"Exit 0 with a plan is the case this route asks about. Exit 0 with --dry-run never asks anything, so a dry run renders the presentation contract's dry-run result and goes to phase 6 with STATUS=OK.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-restore.yaml:79:      - \"Ask the restore question once, in the presentation contract's wording, naming the run directory, each path that will be put back and each path that will be removed because the recorded run created it.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-restore.yaml:102:      - \"Render the presentation contract's restored result with the run directory, each path put back, each path removed, the re-read verdict and STATUS=OK.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-restore.yaml:112:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-toggle.yaml:72:      - \"When the plan status is NO_CHANGE, the variable already has the requested state: render the presentation contract's no-change result and stop with STATUS=OK and no change. Never run a command that changes nothing.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-toggle.yaml:77:      - \"Render the presentation contract's change plan from the planner's output: the variable, its current state, the requested state, the workflows it covers and the exact command. For state off the command is gh variable set <name> --body off. For state on the command is gh variable delete <name>.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-toggle.yaml:93:      - \"When the change was approved and read back, render the presentation contract's mutating result with the command, the verification and the undo command (STATUS=OK).\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-toggle.yaml:101:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-ci-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-check.yaml:6:action: Run .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs once -> render its row table through the presentation contract\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-check.yaml:59:    - \"Render the engine's output through .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt: the row table as printed, the DOCTOR DIAGNOSTIC RESULT summary and the repair for each finding.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-setup.yaml:6:action: Run .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/git-setup-check.cjs once -> render its per-check PASS/FAIL/SKIP/UNKNOWN/DEGRADED verdict and repair lines through the presentation contract\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-setup.yaml:51:    - \"Render the battery's verdict through .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-presentation.txt: the per-check table and the DOCTOR DIAGNOSTIC RESULT summary, with the repair command under each failure.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:85:      - \"Render the presentation contract's standards status and source list\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:93:      - \"Ask the presentation's init prompt; on approve run node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/git-standards.cjs init --apply --json, on anything else render the presentation contract's cancelled result (STATUS=CANCELLED ACTION=cancelled) and stop\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:99:      - \"Ask the presentation's change menu; on done, go to phase_7_report\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:105:      - \"For a setting: run node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/git-standards.cjs set <kind> <dotted.path> <json-value> --json; a removal passes null. Render the presentation's rule change plan with the rules switched on and off and the prose drift\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:106:      - \"For a kind: run node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/git-standards.cjs disable <kind> --json and render the presentation's stop-enforcing plan\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:120:      - \"When the plan listed prose to update, ask the presentation's prose prompt. On approve, edit only the prose lines in the .sk-git/ template that the drift findings name, so they state the new rule; never touch the rules block by hand\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:127:      - \"Render the presentation contract's result: success with each applied change, the files written, the last check result and the undo for each\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-standards.yaml:135:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:53:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:76:      - \"Read .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt for the plan, question, refusal and result wording. Every visible line comes from there.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:84:      - \"Exit 0 with NOTHING TO DO means the repository is already in its target state, which the engine prints without a plan. Render the presentation contract's unchanged result with the engine's own notes, ask nothing, write nothing and go to phase 6 with STATUS=OK.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:86:      - \"If dry_run is true, render the presentation contract's dry-run result from the plan's own lines, print the dry-run line and go to phase 6 with STATUS=OK. A dry run asks nothing and writes nothing, so it runs no question and no apply.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:92:      - \"Ask the embed question once, in the presentation contract's wording, naming the files the plan will create, replace or remove, the backup folder, the router rows the plan would add and the plan digest. The operator answers about the plan the operator has just read, which is this run's plan.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:102:      - \"A nonzero pointer-sync line is the one verdict the run leaves unresolved: the generator rewrites an existing .cursor/rules/skill-routing.md and never creates a missing one, so a repository without that file ends with exit 1 and the mirror still missing. Keep the line as printed, render it in the result's Pointer sync: field, never list .cursor/rules/skill-routing.md in Files changed on the strength of the allowlist that names it, and render a Next: line naming /doctor:runtime-mirrors, whose rows list each generated mirror that drifts with the write form of its checker. The repair chain for the pointer file itself is the presentation's troubleshooting row for A10, because that route does not check it. A repo-rules line that reports an error belongs in Router: the same way.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:117:      - \"When the write ran and read back, render the presentation contract's embedded result with the paths the engine wrote or removed, the pointer-sync and repo-rules lines as they printed, the backup folder, the re-read verdict, the undo block the engine printed and the next line those lines name.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:129:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-hooks.yaml:87:      - \"Render the presentation contract's gate table and hand-off block, naming /doctor:env for the whole-hook kill switches\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-hooks.yaml:88:      - \"Ask the presentation contract's change prompt; on done, go to phase_5_report\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-hooks.yaml:93:      - \"Run node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/git-hook-gates.cjs set <key> on|off --scope local|global --json, which writes nothing, and render its plan with the presentation contract's change plan\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-hooks.yaml:94:      - \"If the script refuses the key (exit 2), render its reason, add the presentation's pointer for that switch, and return to phase_2_present\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-hooks.yaml:109:      - \"When every approved change verified, render the presentation contract's success result with each change, its scope, the verification and its undo command (STATUS=OK)\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-hooks.yaml:117:  presentation: \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-presentation.txt\"\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"rg -n \\\"presentation\\\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/*.yaml | head -40\"}"},"time":{"start":1794533956161,"end":1794533956429}}}}
