owns its cost. It starts the server and pulls the\n+  model only after the one approval, and only for a step the probe found missing.\n   The scan writes only skill-graph.sqlite, which is derived state. Nothing is\n   pulled, started or written before the approval, and a dry run stops after the\n   plan. A no stops with STATUS=CANCELLED and changes nothing.\n \n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\",\"oldString\":\"  command for the operator to run, because a system package install is theirs to\\n  make and the install guide owns its cost. It pulls the model and starts the\\n  server only after the one approval, and only for a step the probe found missing.\",\"newString\":\"  command for the operator to run, because a system package install is theirs to\\n  make and the install guide owns its cost. It starts the server and pulls the\\n  model only after the one approval, and only for a step the probe found missing.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794534462859,"end":1794534463967}}}}
