{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794534470234,"sessionID":"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9","part":{"partID":"prt_1d296eba5001kYc05clGNlIzXr","sessionID":"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9","messageID":"msg_1d296e4cf001KE5EX7bkiWBk1P","type":"tool","id":"call_7009c20fc3c04210b227cfcf","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml","oldString":"Install Ollama is printed for the operator with the install guide's cost and the package manager's own uninstall as its undo. Pull `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` costs `.model.sizeBytes` on disk and undoes with `ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5`. Start `ollama serve` in the background costs `.memory.serveRssKb` resident and undoes by stopping the pid this run started. `skill_graph_scan` costs the scan's own runtime plus `.warm.medianMs` per embedded prompt and needs no undo because the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it.","newString":"Install Ollama is printed for the operator with the install guide's cost and the package manager's own uninstall as its undo. Start `ollama serve` in the background costs `.memory.serveRssKb` resident and undoes by stopping the pid this run started. Pull `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` costs `.model.sizeBytes` on disk and undoes with `ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5`. `skill_graph_scan` costs the scan's own runtime plus `.warm.medianMs` per embedded prompt and needs no undo because the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it."},"output":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml","patch":"Index: .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\n+++ .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\n@@ -104,9 +104,9 @@\n     activities:\n       - \"Read .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt for the probe dashboard, the plan table, the approval prompt, the dry-run result and the final result wording. Every visible line comes from there.\"\n       - \"Run `node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs` when `/api/version` answered, and keep its JSON. Exit 2 means the server stopped answering after the probe, so take the cost from the install guide and say the live measurement was unavailable.\"\n       - \"Render the presentation contract's probe dashboard with the binary, the server version, the model tag and the advisor's lane state.\"\n-      - \"For each missing step, print one plan row through the presentation contract's plan table with columns step, cost and undo. Install Ollama is printed for the operator with the install guide's cost and the package manager's own uninstall as its undo. Pull `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` costs `.model.sizeBytes` on disk and undoes with `ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5`. Start `ollama serve` in the background costs `.memory.serveRssKb` resident and undoes by stopping the pid this run started. `skill_graph_scan` costs the scan's own runtime plus `.warm.medianMs` per embedded prompt and needs no undo because the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it.\"\n+      - \"For each missing step, print one plan row through the presentation contract's plan table with columns step, cost and undo. Install Ollama is printed for the operator with the install guide's cost and the package manager's own uninstall as its undo. Start `ollama serve` in the background costs `.memory.serveRssKb` resident and undoes by stopping the pid this run started. Pull `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` costs `.model.sizeBytes` on disk and undoes with `ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5`. `skill_graph_scan` costs the scan's own runtime plus `.warm.medianMs` per embedded prompt and needs no undo because the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it.\"\n       - \"Never print a cost the measurement or the install guide did not produce. Never offer an undo the operator cannot run.\"\n       - \"When the probe found no missing step, render the presentation contract's final result as already set up, ask nothing, run nothing and stop with STATUS=OK.\"\n \n   phase_3_approval:\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\",\"oldString\":\"Install Ollama is printed for the operator with the install guide's cost and the package manager's own uninstall as its undo. Pull `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` costs `.model.sizeBytes` on disk and undoes with `ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5`. Start `ollama serve` in the background costs `.memory.serveRssKb` resident and undoes by stopping the pid this run started. `skill_graph_scan` costs the scan's own runtime plus `.warm.medianMs` per embedded prompt and needs no undo because the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it.\",\"newString\":\"Install Ollama is printed for the operator with the install guide's cost and the package manager's own uninstall as its undo. Start `ollama serve` in the background costs `.memory.serveRssKb` resident and undoes by stopping the pid this run started. Pull `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` costs `.model.sizeBytes` on disk and undoes with `ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5`. `skill_graph_scan` costs the scan's own runtime plus `.warm.medianMs` per embedded prompt and needs no undo because the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794534468517,"end":1794534470234}}}}
