{"type":"text","timestamp":1794534498951,"sessionID":"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9","part":{"id":"prt_1d2974991001w4qLxQUHSxgcyH","sessionID":"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9","messageID":"msg_1d2971ef60013hp7A6uPfAgGDG","type":"text","text":"T009 complete.\n\n**File written**\n\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml` (new, 173 lines)\n\n**What it contains**\n\n- Phase 1 read-only probes: `command -v ollama`, `/api/version`, `/api/tags`, and `advisor_status --workspace-root \"$PWD\" --include-semantic-health true --format json --warm-only`, with exit 75 handled as `daemon=absent`.\n- Phase 2 plan through `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt`, one row per missing step with cost from `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` or the install guide, and its undo.\n- Phase 3 approval, `STATUS=CANCELLED` on anything but approve, `STATUS=OK` for `--dry-run`.\n- Phase 4 only approved steps: background `ollama serve` then `ollama pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5`; the Ollama install itself is printed only.\n- Phase 5 `skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json`.\n- Phase 6 reruns the probe, requires `laneEnabled` and `commandVectorCoverage.embedded > 0`, and names a daemon restart when `activeEmbedder` is null.\n\n**Verify output**\n\n```text\n$ python3 -c 'import sys,yaml; yaml.safe_load(open(sys.argv[1]))' .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\nYAML OK   (exit 0)\n\n$ rg -n \"CANCELLED|dry_run|skill_graph_scan\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\n16:  dry_run: print_the_plan_then_status_ok\n32:  plan. A no stops with STATUS=CANCELLED and changes nothing.\n41:  scan_command: \"node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json\"\n53:  dry_run: \"--dry-run prints the plan with each missing step's cost and undo, then stops with STATUS=OK before the approval. Nothing is pulled, started or written (default false).\"\n60:    dry_run: false\n72:    - \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database/skill-graph.sqlite, through skill_graph_scan only\"\n79:  invariant: \"Only the steps the plan printed are run, and only after the approval. skill_graph_scan is the only writer inside the repository, and it writes derived state.\"\n108:      - \"For each missing step, print one plan row through the presentation contract's plan table with columns step, cost and undo. Install Ollama is printed for the operator with the install guide's cost and the package manager's own uninstall as its undo. Start `ollama serve` in the background costs `.memory.serveRssKb` resident and undoes by stopping the pid this run started. Pull `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` costs `.model.sizeBytes` on disk and undoes with `ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5`. `skill_graph_scan` costs the scan's own runtime plus `.warm.medianMs` per embedded prompt and needs no undo because the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it.\"\n115:      - \"If dry_run is true, render the presentation contract's dry-run result from the plan's own rows and stop with STATUS=OK. A dry run asks nothing, pulls nothing, starts nothing and writes nothing.\"\n117:      - \"Approve is the only answer that proceeds. Anything else is a no: render the presentation contract's cancelled result, state that nothing was pulled, started or written, and stop with STATUS=CANCELLED ACTION=cancelled.\"\n133:      - \"Run `node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json`.\"\n173:  statuses: [OK, CANCELLED, FAIL]\n```\n\n12 matching lines, so the “at least three” bar is met. YAML parses with exit 0.\n\n**Notes**\n\n- `tasks.md` T009 remains unchecked.\n- No other file was touched. `git status` shows other workers' modifications and scratch output, none of them mine.\n- No blockers.","time":{"start":1794534492561,"end":1794534498951}}}
